actiongroovenc (0.6) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rebrand to ActionGrooveNC: new app ID, paths and icons.
  * Albums are sorted alphabetically.
  * Add "Add to playlist" submenu to album and playlist song menus; menus open on right click.
  * Drag songs from album and playlist views into the queue; play dropped song when queue is empty.
  * Queue is a collapsible, resizable right pane with drag handles and layout polish.
  * Add search bar and German translation.
  * Add shuffle/ordered toggle to album and playlist headers; remove items from the queue.
  * Fix playback crash with ID3-tagged MP3 files.
  * Fix startup crash outside Flatpak; run from source tree via run-dev.py.
  * Fix queue position moves and leftover empty header bars in artist and playlist views.
  * Unify background colors and theme in album, artist, playlist and login views.
  * Play button styling, separator, rounded control buttons and cover spacing.
  * Wrapped dialog: duration label, sorted stats files, share row as list.

 -- Actionschnitzel <actionschnitzel@guideos.de>  Wed, 11 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0100

